<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 529 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 529 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 226 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills and for 303 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills against the central bank's 200 and 300 million zloty offer respectively, the bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
